Package: niayan-management
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-tuf (>= 5.1), python3-requests, python3-cryptography, libzstd1, ca-certificates
Description: niayan management commands and localized artifact tools
 Adopted package management interfaces with media indexing and listing,
 local interim package construction and display, and authenticated download.
 Installed-package mutations and queries require the native controller,
 whose production integration is still under development. No alternate
 package database, privileged launcher or automatic service is installed.
